[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 61.27, "timestamp": "00:01:01", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 64.229, "timestamp": "00:01:04", "text": "明天就是六月了。所以我必須敲定"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 66.789, "timestamp": "00:01:06", "text": "六月第一週的合作計畫。我還有一些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 72.71000000000001, "timestamp": "00:01:12", "text": "空檔期，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 76.95, "timestamp": "00:01:16", "text": "像是週五、週日和週三，我需要安排人來上班。所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 80.55, "timestamp": "00:01:20", "text": "我必須這麼做。是的，我們"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 82.39, "timestamp": "00:01:22", "text": "還有很多規模更大的合作項目。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 85.51, "timestamp": "00:01:25", "text": "首次合作。嗯，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 88.55, "timestamp": "00:01:28", "text": "呃，都是第一次合作，一切都是新的開始。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 90.39, "timestamp": "00:01:30", "text": "提前祝你驕傲月快樂！"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 92.789, "timestamp": "00:01:32", "text": "也祝你驕傲月快樂！"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 95.10900000000001, "timestamp": "00:01:35", "text": "呃，這次我真的是。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 97.27000000000001, "timestamp": "00:01:37", "text": "你來得確實早。薩巴特"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 99.50999999999999, "timestamp": "00:01:39", "text": "之子。是的。  你好"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 101.429, "timestamp": "00:01:41", "text": "。我得製作縮圖"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 104.069, "timestamp": "00:01:44", "text": "等等。讓我快速地做一下"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 107.749, "timestamp": "00:01:47", "text": "。等待。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 109.67, "timestamp": "00:01:49", "text": "呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 111.50999999999999, "timestamp": "00:01:51", "text": "我得把JC的縮圖也放上去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 113.83, "timestamp": "00:01:53", "text": "。哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 116.95, "timestamp": "00:01:56", "text": "對了，"}]